### REST Client system variables, unquoted
POST http://localhost:3000/system-vars
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "request_id": "{{$guid}}",
  "updated_at": {{$timestamp}},
  "price": {{$randomInt 5 200}},
  "address": {"city": "Seoul"}
}

### request-variable reference, unquoted
POST http://localhost:3000/request-var
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": {{createOrder.response.body.$.id}},
  "note": "x"
}
